        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>MultipatchLagrangeInterpolator2D</name>
        <briefdescription>
<para>A MultipatchInterpolation2D which uses a 2D Lagrange interpolation on every patch. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>On each patch, the Lagrange interpolation is defined on the bases (Basis1OnPatch&lt;Patch&gt;, Basis2OnPatch&lt;Patch&gt;) and the grids (Grid1, Grid2) of the patch.</para>
<para>The extrapolation outside of the global domain is handled by MultipatchExtrapolationRule, so the extrapolation rules on each patch are null (or periodic along periodic dimensions).</para>
<para>The execution space is the one of the patch locator (PatchLocator::exec_space).</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>PatchLocator</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The operator used to find the patch where a coordinate is physically located. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>MultipatchExtrapolationRule</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The extrapolation rule used outside of the global domain (e.g. <ref refid="structConstantExtrapolationRuleOnion" kindref="compound">ConstantExtrapolationRuleOnion</ref> or <ref refid="structNullExtrapolationRule" kindref="compound">NullExtrapolationRule</ref>). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Basis1OnPatch</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>A type template such that Basis1OnPatch&lt;Patch&gt; is the Lagrange basis (<ref refid="classUniformLagrangeBasis" kindref="compound">UniformLagrangeBasis</ref> or <ref refid="classNonUniformLagrangeBasis" kindref="compound">NonUniformLagrangeBasis</ref>) along the first dimension of the patch. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Basis2OnPatch</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>A type template such that Basis2OnPatch&lt;Patch&gt; is the Lagrange basis along the second dimension of the patch. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>DataType</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The type of the function values (default: double). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
